(Linda Jackson writes:)

> How about adding the ability to SET traps that monsters could fall into?

I had been thinking the same thing lately. It would seem logical that
if a wand of polymorph, teleport, or generate monster were pointed
down they should make a trap of that kind. It would only work if there
was bare floor underneath, otherwise they would behave as they
normally do. Wands of digging and trap doors work that way now. There
would be too many traps if every kind of wand did this, but at least
somthing along these lines would be fun. Someone might then play in
debug mode and leave customized :-> levels for others .....
